  <item>
    <title>再见爱人5｜嘉宾全下车，回看36问复盘关系隐患</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69626a4fe235ea65bc26f014</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69626a4fe235ea65bc26f014</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 10 Jan 2026 15:14:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>再见爱人走向最终选择，36问环节经典总结旅途18天的关系与个人成长，所有的隐藏和面具此刻都将无所遁形，我们一起来捋一捋两对嘉宾的关系中那个隐藏在房间的大象到底是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>远山遥：“生育如果谈’价值兑现‘，那就是个商业博弈问题。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>啾娃：“这个家一个人赚钱不够用了，现在就需要两个人都出来工作。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>【亮点时刻】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a> Q&amp;A：TA身上的哪些特质，契合了你对伴侣的期待？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="213">03:33</a> 情侣之间有3个月的伪装期？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="306">05:06</a> 奉子成婚的坏处不仅仅关乎传统婚嫁流程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="465">07:45</a> Q&amp;A：这十八天相处里，你是否曾对对方心动？是哪个瞬间？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="718">11:58</a> 如何看待梁松对家庭的执念？理解or反感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="854">14:14</a> 梁松是妈宝男吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="955">15:55</a> Q&amp;A：若无他人帮助与支持，你们二人将如何携手运转这个家庭？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1246">20:46</a> 生育是可以兑现长期饭票的价值吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> Q&amp;A：再给你一次选择的机会，你是否还会与对方步入婚姻？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2210">36:50</a> Q&amp;A：若能撤回一句对对方说过的话，你最想撤回哪一句？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> Q&amp;A：这段婚姻中，最让你想向对方道歉的一件事是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2753">45:53</a> Q&amp;A：和对方在一起24小时你想聊什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3103">51:43</a> 为什么不能忍受伴侣“躺平”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3423">57:03</a> 无法共事工作的人无法共事婚姻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3781">1:03:01</a> 李诗嬅的苛刻像老师对待笨学生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4348">1:12:28</a> 共情能力在变弱的时候也就变好了</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6718a0027b88179cc55964d7/lor5YOfqDYDRehCGmaOdcLAQ-Bzk.m4a" length="83351990" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:25:49</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlWCA8DiRQFYcR7AcQOsC8cI9L6x.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>KPOP｜不负责任涛，爱豆到底能不能恋爱？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/695497262db086f897f3e039</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">695497262db086f897f3e039</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 31 Dec 2025 03:35:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Kpop杂谈系列一起回归啦！跟随着kpop大事件一起从全新的角度，不受限制的视野再次了解我们喜欢的这个行业吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>都说爱豆不能恋爱，这个约定俗成的行业“道德规范”为什么存在？又是谁制定的？是一辈子不能谈还是某个时间不能谈？为什么要这样规定？最后的受益者又是谁呢？本期将从追星女和追星女之外的角度，和两位主播一起重新看待这个问题。</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>PS：讨论中提到的案例部分为官方承认，部分为无证实传闻，未证实的会在聊天过程中预先声明，仅供参考自行判断。</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>远山遥：“规则是什么？自己够强大全世界的规则都会向你倾斜。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>啾娃：“和他们的私生活保持距离感反而令我更加安心。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>【亮点时刻】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">02:45</a> 免责声明</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="309">05:09</a> 回看二代团，氛围从宽松转为严苛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="429">07:09</a> 爱豆不能恋爱？在我这里还是疑问句</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="635">10:35</a> 梦女？妈粉？CP粉？粉丝类型比例与恋爱舆论反馈的相关性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1226">20:26</a> 爱豆和素人恋爱，释放的可能性让我感到更加「危险」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1391">23:11</a> 心理委员，我不得劲！谈谈塌房背刺感的真实来源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1423">23:43</a> 原因1: 贩卖性幻想与无归属权状态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1462">24:22</a> 原因2: 刺激消费与反向操控</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1630">27:10</a> 恋爱藏好是个悖论，现代社会越火越没有隐私</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1870">31:10</a> 粉豆同理，先确定你想要什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2105">35:05</a> 生活经验与创作灵感的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2491">41:31</a> 不能只用一只脚走路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3140">52:20</a> 保持距离和想象，对过度暴露的恐惧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3578">59:38</a> 粉丝与爱豆之间也需要磨合</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3910">1:05:10</a> 新年快乐！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6718a0027b88179cc55964d7/ln1OGVHcsV7jc51amBKK3KVUOlsQ.m4a" length="63502356" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:05:22</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvEZbNd-wFQ3Vf0kUhPQiQCIu26c.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>再见爱人5｜理解何美延，不理解何美延</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69421bdc5e8cb26fdf3f0992</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69421bdc5e8cb26fdf3f0992</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 17 Dec 2025 03:02:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好我们终于回来啦！再见爱人5从开播到现在都有关注，在经历了一对嘉宾“离开”后，这个略显单薄的第五季终于因为何美延有了讨论度。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期的重点就是关于「何美延」这一对嘉宾的亲密关系，我们每个人或许都有成为何美延的瞬间，我们理解她的疯狂和对爱的渴望，但我们也在经历中逐渐摆脱了何美延的状态。</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于「何美延」，我理解她，又不理解她。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>远山遥：“她不爱梁松，需要被爱的本质还是自私。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>啾娃：“我曾经像她一样追问，但现在已经走出来了。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>【亮点时刻】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="472">07:52</a> 头巾事件讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 爱是合作不是牺牲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="746">12:26</a> 当你需要去证明被爱，你已经不被爱了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="819">13:39</a> 梁松为什么不欣赏何美延</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="998">16:38</a> 家庭失职是否还有资格要求爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1237">20:37</a> 婆婆是否应该介入夫妻生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1451">24:11</a> 梁松最大问题是过于自恋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1810">30:10</a> 当我也曾经是何美延的时期，解药是多经历分离</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2250">37:30</a> 面对说教的处理方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2484">41:24</a> 越亲近越礼貌，长期关系需要相敬如宾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2747">45:47</a> 他们还有爱吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2912">48:32</a> 李诗嬅与猴儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">1:00:00</a> 第五季的关系类型都缺乏深度</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6718a0027b88179cc55964d7/lo9fwm5cuvchXoxx1VuC4scQRMcj.m4a" length="70883241" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:12:58</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlX_oOr6CwWynKvlxYTfj-RzbDd8.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>激活生命力的行动清单</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/687ce28ba9dec925003b80c9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">687ce28ba9dec925003b80c9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 20 Jul 2025 17:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天又是一个令人抗拒的周一，在枯竭重复的日常事物当众，有哪些低门槛的事情能够激发我们生活的动力？</span></p><span></span><p><span>比起老生常谈的那些鸡汤，我们要来分享一些奇怪又简单的小事情，如果你感兴趣或许也可以一起？！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>远山遥：“过山车的刺激，抢票软件能让我体验到。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>啾娃：“控笔像一场修行，在确定的方向逐步前进。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>【亮点时刻】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="124">02:04</a> 控笔练习，奇怪小众但解压！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="549">09:09</a> 迷上抢票就算了，更是在黄牛的道路上一去不复返...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="894">14:54</a> 从0开始跳舞尝试，把这节课学完就很有成就感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1690">28:10</a> 写小说，一场绑着安全带的精神冒险</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2214">36:54</a> 做播客，不可能的主动社交借由节目实现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2563">42:43</a> 性格会改变吗？从我们的故事讲起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2872">47:52</a> 目标越小，幸福越大</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpZPLUG5A9jDQkmrYqfce4ok4ABW.JPG"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6718a0027b88179cc55964d7/lmE6Qkf-uhU-w89yHeZ0-E8Ydnfh.m4a" length="54041132" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:54:57</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FneRg2t14w6_J2jSmdVwrNjf_BLB.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>BTS郑号锡&amp;权志龙演唱会后记，奔赴我们所爱之人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/686553b860f8f77d40889297</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">686553b860f8f77d40889297</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 02 Jul 2025 15:59:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好！6月没有发播客的两位主播偷偷看了3场演唱会，分别是BTS郑号锡5.18澳门场，6.13首尔安可（附赠全员退役首次亮相ver.）和权志龙5.26大阪场演唱会。</span></p><span></span><p><span>从抢票到线下，经历了人类大战itp(韩国售票平台之一)到独身前往异国他乡的一个月时间里，过程中我们经历了许多趣事也遇到了善良的人，今天就一起来开心地聊聊这三场con吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>远山遥：“和泡菜妹樱花妹用日语英语大聊三小时，我们的外语都得到了提升。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>啾娃："我用ai推算抢票排队进度，意外还挺准！"</span></p><span></span><p><span>【高光时刻】</span></p><span></span><p><span>抢票：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="94">01:34</a> 开始抢票啦！昼夜不眠的我们大战itp</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="556">09:16</a> AI推算排队进度真的准</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="978">16:18</a> 韩国平台city line 和 itp 的不同之处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1221">20:21</a> 日本抢票抽选制</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1570">26:10</a> 携程&amp;klook海外版比国内版容易抢到</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1889">31:29</a> 实名制与非实名制的不同玩法</span></p><span></span><p><span>线下：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1710">28:30</a> 日韩的应援氛围真的更好？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2376">39:36</a> 澳门场是中粉狂欢的天堂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2471">41:11</a> 澳门场和韩国场的开销估算（体验舒适ver.）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2722">45:22</a> 一排小号的神奇体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2964">49:24</a> 为了扒杆8小时没人去厕所</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3025">50:25</a> 见送 (MG)环节能不能合照全凭反应速度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3289">54:49</a> 血泪教训，离嘉宾席太近反而什么都看不到</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3418">56:58</a> 5w人体育场和1w人体育馆的氛围体验差异</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3575">59:35</a> 一点点吐槽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4068">1:07:48</a> 原来如此！日本演唱会真的不能拍照吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4361">1:12:41</a> 日本演唱会开销估算</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4460">1:14:20</a> 信息差，出国看con其实更省钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4676">1:17:56</a> 小红薯找追星搭子的超成功案例</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4727">1:18:47</a> 好开心！认识的韩国欧尼和日本妹妹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4952">1:22:32</a> 没有应援棒也没事，有的话更好</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgL8Wfco687N8NW-stmuyDie0Q35.JPG"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6718a0027b88179cc55964d7/lvQx4OJGZCigalgPLS6o_zdbXvq2.m4a" length="85958750" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:27:10</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpRaehIyP1t6gC5B87KBp4fL-ZWV.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>do脸血泪史｜为了变美，聊聊我们花钱遭罪的那些事...</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/682baea2fcbc2e206bbe94a6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">682baea2fcbc2e206bbe94a6</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 19 May 2025 22:33:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好！这是生活闲聊新系列的第一期，分享我们日常生活中不日常的小小瞬间。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天的主题是「do脸血泪史」，分享两位主播亲身经历过的微调&amp;医美项目，在充满迷茫和冲动的20s时期，我们都做过哪些花钱受罪的项目？真的会有效果吗？如果再选择一次我们还会不会做？</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>*本期节目不推荐任何具体医院，任何项目均有风险</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>远山遥：“为了不凸嘴我拔掉了四颗好牙，正畸的每天都在牙龈出血...”</span></p><span></span><p><span>啾娃：“刮掉眼部脂肪的时候我是清醒地睁眼看着的。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>【亮点时刻】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a> 18岁割眼袋，没做任何功课的我上了手术台</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="368">06:08</a> 远赴日本的双眼皮埋线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="862">14:22</a> 价格翻倍，国外技术真的好亿点？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="982">16:22</a> 做鼻子是一个永无止境的返厂地狱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1187">19:47</a> 静态是好看的，动态是超假的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1365">22:45</a> 大龄整形正畸，斥巨资拔掉了四颗好牙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1940">32:20</a> 试试才知道，公立医院一定比私营诊所更可信？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2250">37:30</a> 光电类医美项目像一场信念游戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2757">45:57</a> 医美界最贵的消费是贪便宜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2933">48:53</a> 所有调整都有联动效应</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3108">51:48</a> 延伸话题：对于“服美役”，我们的想法不一样</span></p>]]></description>
